  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About Our Brand and Products:</strong><br><br>Raising Mama creates buttery-soft bamboo baby pajamas designed to support both babies and the mothers who love them. </p><p>Every piece features thoughtful, uplifting prints that speak directly to moms—because we believe what a baby wears can also wrap a mother in comfort. <br><br>Plus, we donate a portion from every pajama sold to Postpartum Support International to support maternal mental health.</p><p><strong>What Makes Us Different:</strong><br>We’re more than just a pajama brand. We’re a movement built on honoring motherhood, helping babies sleep better, and breaking the silence around postpartum struggles. <br><br>Our pajamas are made from high-quality, eco-friendly bamboo and feature exclusive prints with messages like <em>“You’re doing great, Mama”</em>—designed to be both comforting and conversation-starting.</p><p><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Earn <strong>15% commission</strong> on every sale you generate</p></li><li><p>Your followers get <strong>15% off</strong> with a unique coupon code</p></li><li><p>After just <strong>$100 in sales</strong>, you’ll receive a <strong>free pair of pajamas</strong></p></li><li><p>Enjoy <strong>30% off all Raising Mama orders</strong> for yourself</p></li></ul><p><strong>How to Promote Us:</strong><br>Share our mission and products through:</p><ul><li><p>Instagram Reels and Stories showing our cute, comfy prints</p></li><li><p>Honest reviews or unboxings of the pajamas</p></li><li><p>Blog posts or email newsletters on baby sleep, postpartum support, or mom must-haves</p></li><li><p>Linking directly to our website with your personalized referral code</p></li></ul><p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>We welcome creators who care about maternal mental health, postpartum advocacy, and helping moms feel seen. Whether you're a parent, doula, or simply passionate about supporting motherhood, we’d love to partner with you. Let’s raise each other up—one pajama at a time.</p></div></div>",
